.TH DANBY-COMETCATCH 1
.SH NAME
danby-cometcatch \- gravitational scattering and comet capture by Jupiter
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B danby/cometcatch
.SH MODEL
Sun and Jupiter gravitationally scatter a massless comet. The graph reports
heliocentric specific energy: negative final energy is bound, while positive
energy is an escaping orbit. Jupiter distance identifies the encounter.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/danby/plugin/cometcatch.b
